<title>KENYA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT PAKISTAN IN ONE-DAYER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT PAKISTAN IN ONE-DAYER.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat Pakistan by 62 runs in their one-day match in the Kenyan Centenary four-nation cricket tournament on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 321-8 in 50 overs (D.Cullinan 124, J.Rhodes 121), Pakistan 259 all out in 42.3 overs.</p>
